bottomparticipants

actor User
boundary "View Replies UI" as UI
boundary Router
control ReplyController
control ReplyService
entity ":ReplyModel" as ReplyModel
database MongoDB

User -> UI: 1. Open comment replies
activate User
activate UI

UI -> Router: 2. GET /reply/{commentId}
activate Router

Router -> ReplyController: 3. Call get replies
activate ReplyController

ReplyController -> ReplyService: 4. Call get replies
activate ReplyService

ReplyService -> ReplyModel: 5. Get replies
activate ReplyModel
ReplyModel -> MongoDB: 6. Get replies
activate MongoDB

MongoDB --> ReplyModel: 7. Return replies
deactivate MongoDB
ReplyModel --> ReplyService: 8. Return replies
deactivate ReplyModel

ReplyService --> ReplyController: 9. Return replies
deactivate ReplyService

ReplyController --> Router: 10. Return replies
deactivate ReplyController
Router --> UI: 11. Show replies
deactivate Router
UI --> User: 12. View replies with votes
deactivate UI
deactivate User
@enduml
